Feature flags

The `Web app`, the `Mobile app` and the `Backend` each read from the
`Flag service`, with the label `read flags`. A `Product manager` uses the
`Flag console`, with the label `change`. The `Flag console` writes to the
`Flag service`, with the label `write`.
---
Web app, Mobile app, Backend -> Flag service: read flags
Product manager -> Flag console: change
Flag console -> Flag service: write
